00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.220
The modest clothes taught us that valuation support alone

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.720
rarely drive sustained outperformance without a fresh catalyst.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.940
With broad market beta clearly dominating,

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:51.280
let's examine a targeted strategy

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:54.400
designed to capture policy-driven premiums instead.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.760
Geopolitical premium investing involves overweighting assets

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.740
that benefit from policy shifts,

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.600
such as tariffs or critical mineral demand,

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.640
rather than broad market beta.

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:09.400
Today's proposed 10 to 12.5% duties

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:13.100
on 60 trading partners and the Canadian antimony discovery

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.600
highlight how quickly supply chain security

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.560
can reprise entire sectors.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.440
Investors can implement this by screening

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:23.080
TSX listed miners and processors

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.320
for non-Chinese sources of defense critical inputs,

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:30.860
then size positions at 3% to 5% of a TFSA

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.840
to limit single-name risk.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.260
The approach has historically delivered

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:39.080
during trade war periods when domestic content roles tighten.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.340
It carries elevated volatility

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.160
if diplomatic tensions ease.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.840
Use free government mineral lists and company filings

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.900
to confirm jurisdiction before entry,

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.320
always layer in volume confirmation

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.700
above the 20-day average before scaling.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.780
This policy-focused lens pairs naturally

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.940
with today's concrete catalyst trade.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.380
Our practice investment of the day

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:05.260
