00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.600
This is the exact scenario where our earlier rule

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.660
about volume confirmation would have helped.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.820
The new rule is to always require volume

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:53.120
above the 20-day average before entering momentum trades

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.600
on partnership announcements.

